  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently the --map option is used during import only.   However, moving forward we won't be using the fcrepo-import-export tool for imports since we expect folks to export from 4 and 5 and then migrate (via the fcrepo-upgrade-utils) to 6.  As such, there is no way for folks to change their  context path in the process of upgrading.  ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The task then is to ensure that --map is applied during exports.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
