  "description": "<p>Currently the --map option is used during import only.   However, moving forward we won't be using the fcrepo-import-export tool for imports since we expect folks to export from 4 and 5 and then migrate (via the fcrepo-upgrade-utils) to 6.  As such, there is no way for folks to change their  context path in the process of upgrading.  </p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>The task then is to ensure that --map is applied during exports.</p>\n\n<p> </p>",
